Hello everyone,

Poppr version 2.0.1 has just been released on CRAN and is available for all systems. This version fixes a major bug when importing diploid data with genalex that contained missing data. Details are here: https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1

You can find details about version 2 here: https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0

